		<Meldungstext>\T\L\S\K\I0 = Compressor ON
 1-20 = Compressor OFF\Y\S\K\N

J\L\S\K\I \L\B\K\ACompressor ON:\L\S\K\I
 (\L\S\K\ACode\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IEvent\L\S\K\I - Condition)\L\S\K\A
 0\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IOK\L\S\K\I - A/C system switched on, all conditions are fulfilled;\Y\S\K\N

J\L\S\K\I \L\B\K\ACompressor OFF:\L\S\K\I
 (\L\S\K\ACode\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IProcess\L\S\K\I - Condition)\L\S\K\A
 1\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IPressure\L\S\K\I - Excessive coolant pressure, thresholds are a function of the coolant pressure; shutdown at p \L\S\G\N&gt;=\L\S\K\I 32 bar, shutdown at p \L\S\G\N=&lt;\L\S\K\I 24 bar;\L\S\K\A
 2\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IFan\L\S\K\I - fan defective and  actual voltage &lt; 3 V;\L\S\K\A
 3\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IVacuum\L\S\K\I - coolant pressure very low, thresholds are a function of the outside temperature, deactivation at p \L\S\G\N=&lt;\L\S\K\I 1.4 bar, activation at p \L\S\G\N&gt;=\L\S\K\I 2.0 bar;\L\S\K\A
 5\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IEngine start\L\S\K\I - Duration of engine run time \L\S\G\N&lt;\L\S\K\I 1 sec. (engine start is not detected);\L\S\K\A
 6\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IECON\L\S\K\I - Mode ECON (ECON button pressed or AC button not pressed);\L\S\K\A
 7\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IA/C system OFF\L\S\K\I - Fan switch in position 0;\L\S\K\A
 8\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IOutside temperature\L\S\K\I - Outside temperature low, deactivation at an outside temperature \L\S\G\N&lt;\L\S\K\I 1.5 °C or if the control module does not receive a current value or receives an implausible value via the CAN. Activation at outside temperature \L\S\G\N&gt;\L\S\K\N 2\L\S\K\I.5 °C;\L\S\K\A
 10\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IUndervoltage \L\S\K\I- Vehicle system voltage very low, &lt; 9.5 V;\L\S\K\A
 11\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IDeactivation of indicator light for excessive temperature\L\S\K\I - Engine temperature &gt; 118 °C, (Deactivation is a function of the software version);\L\S\K\A
 12\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IDeactivation of the engine control module via CAN\L\S\K\I - Cause, for example, engine temperature, coolant fan control module, kick down;\L\S\K\A
 13\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IOvervoltage\L\S\K\I - vehicle electrical system voltage too high, U(terminal 15) or (terminal 30) &gt; 16 V;\L\S\K\A
 14\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IEvaporator temperature freezing risk\L\S\K\I - temperature of the evaporator very low;\L\S\K\A
 15\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\INo vehicle coding or incorrect vehicle coding\L\S\K\I;\L\S\K\A
 16\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\ICompressor activation\L\S\K\I - Malfunction in path for activation of the regulating valve, e.g., open circuit/short circuit to B+;\L\S\K\A
 17\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IPressure sensor\L\S\K\I - no signal or implausible signal of the pressure sensor (SignalPWM);\L\S\K\A
 18\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IDeactivation of the engine speed during stoppage \L\S\K\I- Deactivation for a period of at least 3 seconds at engine speed &gt; 3,000 rpm and vehicle speed &lt; 15 km/h;\L\S\K\A
 19\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IDeactivation of loads\L\S\K\I - Deactivation via the CAN by the vehicle electrical system control module (defrosting deactivates this code again);\L\S\K\A
 20\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IOutput DTM\L\S\K\I - during the check of the actuators</Meldungstext>
